      "userId": "58442db3ee4a2400116eb406",
      "created": 1794343395,
      "updated": 1794343395
    },
    {
      "id": "6af3424200000000008bf7ec",
      "text": "[はるひ.icon]",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1794327107,
      "updated": 1794327109
    },
    {
      "id": "6af3424300000000008bf7ee",
      "text": "\t夕方帰ってきて即眠ってしまう癖8年経っても直らない",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1794327109,
      "updated": 1794327137
    },
    {
      "id": "6af3ed0200000000009ea09e",
      "text": "\t\t8年やってるならもう習慣かも[caki.icon]",
      "userId": "6923e3b6e09f0be0924872ef",
      "created": 1794370820,
      "updated": 1794370830
    },
    {
      "id": "6af3425b00000000008bf7f0",
      "text": "\tMuse課金した",
      "userId": "60c9f2f6c225a50020b8bbfc",
      "created": 1794327132,
      "updated": 1794327143
    },
    {
      "id": "6af3a5af00000000009a6192",
      "text": "\t\t迷い中[sta.icon][Nrem.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1794352560,
      "updated": 1794368589
    },
    {
      "id": "6af3e0900000000000af51c2",
      "text": "\t\t課金すると良いことがある？[mtane0412.icon]",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1794367633,
      "updated": 1794367636
    },
    {
      "id": "6af3e0da0000000000af51c3",
      "text": "\t\t モデルが[Muse Spark]から[Muse Wonder]というのに変わるのか",
      "userId": "5ae7fecf7766b7001455cbd3",
      "created": 1794367707,
      "updated": 1794367719
    },
    {
      "id": "6af472d900000000006989c5",
      "text": "\t\t 無料もWonderになったってザッカーバーグが言ってた[基素.icon]",
      "userId": "59fb21121207900012774b17",
      "created": 1794405081,
      "updated": 1794405112
    },
    {
      "id": "6af4caca00000000000683a1",
      "text": "\t\t 使用量が緩和されて遠慮なく使えるようになるのではと予想[sta.icon]",
      "userId": "5a4873ab2e26fb001479d3a9",
      "created": 1794427595,
      "updated": 1794427612
    },
    {
      "id": "6af388600000000000e68b5a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5f11a68e5fc065001ecf5795",
      "created": 1794345076,
      "updated": 1794345076
    },
    {
      "id": "6af388600000000000e68b5b",
      "text": "[hiro.icon]",
      "userId": "5f11a68e5fc065001ecf5795",
      "created": 1794345076,
      "updated": 1794345077
    },
    {
      "id": "6af388610000000000e68b5c",
      "text": " [内の黒船の朝 https://dlt.kitetu.com/KNo.F85E/555F-A492]",
      "userId": "5f11a68e5fc065001ecf5795",
      "created": 1794345077,
      "updated": 1794345088
    },
    {
      "id": "6af3424300000000008bf7ed",
